            "content" : "Proof. (i-1) In view of the definition of Errη and fη, we have E[h(ˆxη) + ηf(ˆxη)] − fη∗ ≤ Errη. Also, from the definition of fη∗, we have fη∗ ≤ fη(x∗) = h∗ + ηf∗. From the preceding two relations, we obtain"
